  📖 Canon: Before you write this, read Chapter 1 of Designing Data-Intensive Applications (DDIA) - specifically the section on "Thinking About Data Systems." It frames exactly this:
  you're not building an API, you're building a data system with specific reliability, scalability, and maintainability requirements.

